cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these queries, please cite this repository."
title: "EntraHuntKit: ATT&CK-mapped KQL threat-hunting queries and IOC lists for Entra ID, Intune and Microsoft 365"
abstract: >-
  A curated corpus of paste-ready KQL threat-hunting queries for Microsoft
  Defender XDR Advanced Hunting and Microsoft Sentinel, each mapped to MITRE
  ATT&CK, together with sourced indicator lists. Every query names the tables
  and columns it reads, so a detection engineer can audit it before running it.
type: software
